reagent-name-au14-resin = resin
reagent-desc-au14-resin = A thick, amber sap drawn out of a tree.

au14-tree-verb-branch = Break off a branch
au14-tree-branch-broken = You break a branch off the tree.
au14-tree-no-branch = The tree has no branch left to break off.
au14-tree-tapped = You cut a hole in the bark for the resin to run out of.
au14-tree-already-tapped = There is already a hole in the bark.
au14-tree-no-hole = There is no hole in the bark: cut one with a knife first.
au14-tree-dry = The tree has given its resin and has none to give yet.
au14-tree-no-room = The container has no room for the resin.
au14-tree-collected = You collect { $amount } of resin.
au14-tree-examine-hole = There is a hole in the bark, and resin runs out of it.
au14-tree-examine-dry = The tree has given its resin and is dry for now.
